From f4b99b4079edf9448f299138e0011d4cf2a4ff9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UMP <ump@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 48/90] launcher: the mod browser installs Fabric mods and
 shader packs into an instance with Java mods on

An instance with Fabric 26.3 mods on (java_mods) gets the browser's Fabric 26.3 files as they are into mods-java/, which the Java mod bridge runs, with their required mods and without Fabric API (Horizon's own, pinned): Target::bridge. Modrinth's shader packs (the shaders/ format, which the game runs) are offered and go into shaderpacks/; before, the browser refused them.

UMP: mods install farmers-delight-refabricated, waystones (+ balm, shogi), bsl-shaders; mods remove; mods search --kind shader. New-player test 14/14 with adding a mod by its name.
